{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cf04f9ee-1cf9-8616-9983-f01c66ebfcc1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T14:34:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Monteiro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:31:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:31:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, I got a water and sewer bill that's higher than it should be, and I want it looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:32:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Can I get the account number or the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:32:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. I've got two properties, so I have two bills here. Um, the one I'm reading is the wrong one, that's the rental I own. I'm renting the other. Okay, the one for where I live, the number ends in 4418."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I have 4418 up. The last bill is sixty-two dollars and fifteen cents. Is that the one you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:32:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's up from last time and I haven't changed anything. I think the reading is off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:32:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see the reading went up compared to the prior quarter. That can come from a leak, like a running toilet, or from an estimated read being corrected. I can flag it for a re-read."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. And put that explanation in writing for me. The estimate part, and the re-read. I want it on paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send a written note with the account details and the re-read request. I'll need a mailing address on file, which I see here, so that's covered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:33:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Also, is there any discount for low-income or elderly households? My mother's on the other account, the rental, and she's on a fixed income."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:33:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There may be a program for seniors or low income, but I don't have the eligibility details in front of me. I can have someone from the billing office send you the application information with the letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:33:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, do that. Honestly, I'd rather just pay this one now so it's not hanging over me. Gas dropped a few cents this morning, that made my day, so I'll take the win and get this done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:33:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I can take a card over the phone whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five five five five, five five five five, five five five five, four four four four. Expiration oh seven, twenty-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So that's 5555, 5555, 5555, 4444, expiring 07/27, for sixty-two dollars and fifteen cents. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:33:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's processed. I've noted the re-read request, and the letter will go out this week. If the re-read changes the amount, the difference will show as a credit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:34:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you for calling. Take care."
    }
  ],
